## ■ニゲラ 中距離プロンプト

Create a dark elegant emblem logo for “House Ririka,” using a Nigella flower as the main motif. Design it as a refined crest or symbolic emblem, with delicate thin petals and fine linework. The logo should express observation, structure, quiet intelligence, boundaries, and calm central control. Add subtle circular or compass-like framing and faint geometric system lines, so it feels like a core node inside a quiet system.

Use a cold and restrained color palette: silver blue, pale blue, muted steel, cold white, and soft gray on a dark background. Keep the composition centered, balanced, calm, and slightly symmetrical. The overall feeling should be quiet, clean, intelligent, untouchable, observant, and elegant.

Style: dark fantasy emblem, refined crest, elegant symbolic logo, slightly mechanical but still organic. Avoid cute style, bright cheerful colors, excessive romance, clutter, or noisy decoration. No text, no letters, black or very dark background.